{"sourceUrl":"https://ggxy.cug.edu.cn/info/1020/10713.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:31.912791+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ggxy.cug.edu.cn/info/1020/10713.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span>根据《中国地质大学</span><span>（</span><span>武汉</span><span>）</span><span>2027</span><span>年</span><span>接收</span><span>推免</span><span>生</span><span>招</span><span>生</span><span>录取</span><span>工作</span><span>办法</span><span>》</span><span>（</span><span><span>地大研发〔</span><span>202</span></span><span>6</span><span>〕</span><span>5</span><span>0</span><span>号</span><span>）</span><span>文件精神，为做好</span><span>我院</span><span>2</span><span>027</span><span>年</span><span>接收</span><span>推免</span><span>生</span><span>招</span><span>生</span><span>录取工作，</span><span>特制定本办法</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>一、指导思想</span></p><p><span>我院</span><span>2</span><span>027</span><span>年</span><span>接收</span><span>推免</span><span>生</span><span>招生</span><span>录取</span><span>工作</span><span>围绕落实立德树人根本任务</span><span>，</span> <span>以提高质量为核心，</span><span><span>坚持</span></span><span>科学、规范、公平的原则，</span><span><span>以德为先、全面衡量、择优选拔</span></span><span>，</span><span>不断加强监督管理，切实严明招生纪律，</span><span>着力</span><span>选拔</span><span>培养</span><span>拔尖</span><span>创新</span><span>人才</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>二、接收推免生学科专业及</span><span>招生</span><span>计划</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>专业代码</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>专业名称</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>接收</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>推免</span></strong><strong><span>生</span></strong><strong><span>类型</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>接收</span></strong><strong><span>推免生</span></strong><strong><span>计划数</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>03</span><span>0100</span></p></td><td><p><span>法学</span></p></td><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>14</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>03</span><span>5102</span></p></td><td><p><span>法律（</span><span>法学</span><span>）</span></p></td><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>9</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>0401</span><span>00</span></p></td><td><p><span>教育学</span></p></td><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>5</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>08</span><span>5700</span></p></td><td><p><span>资源与</span><span>环境</span></p></td><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>2</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>12</span><span>0</span><span>400</span></p></td><td><p><span>公共管理学</span></p></td><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>35</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>120</span><span>403</span></p></td><td><p><span>教育经济</span><span>与管理</span></p></td><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>4</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>12</span><span>0405</span></p></td><td><p><span>土地资源</span><span>管理</span></p></td><td><p><span>硕士生</span></p></td><td><p><span>55</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>120</span><span>400</span></p></td><td><p><span>公共管理学</span></p></td><td><p><span>直博生</span></p></td><td><p><span>2</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong><span><span>说明：公共管理学专业推免计划</span><span>3</span></span></strong><strong><span>5</span></strong><strong><span><span>人，其中应急管理方向推免计划</span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong><strong><span>人。</span></strong></p><p><span>三、申请条件</span></p><p><span>1.中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党</span><span>领导，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>.具有推荐免试资格高校的应届本科毕业生，并获得所在院校推荐免试资格，推荐手续完备，材料齐全。</span></p><p><span>3</span><span>.本科在校期间学习成绩优异，诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果及其他违法违纪受处分记录。</span></p><p><span>4</span><span>.</span><span>我院</span><span>欢迎并鼓励优秀生源以本科直博方式在</span><span>我院</span><span>深造</span><span>。</span><span>申请考生需先跟博士生导师联</span><span>系确认接收意向。</span></p><p><span>①</span><span>选拔条件：本科阶段学习成绩优良；通过英语六级考试，或托福、雅思通过留学资格</span><span>，</span><span><span>或有三个月以上的国外留学经历，或以第一作者发表过英文文章；具有一定科研经历并获得全国性学科竞赛奖励，或在</span><span>T5及以上分区期刊上发表学术论文，或获得授权国家发明专利。</span></span></p><p><span>②</span><span>选拔程序：具有学术型推荐免试资格的申请考生，在复试前提出申请</span><span>（</span><span>在复试情况表上注明</span><span>）</span><span><span>，经博士生导师同意，通过复试考核无异议，在教育部</span><span>“推免服务系统”开放后，完成系统报名和录取，申请类型选择“直博生”。</span></span></p><p><span>四、接收程序</span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>.</span></span> <span>8<span>月</span><span>31</span><span>日，学校已开启推免生预报名工作</span></span><span>，</span><span>具有推荐免试资格的申请考生</span><span>均可</span><span>报名</span><span>。</span><span>所有正式报名工作均需在研招网推免系统完成</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>2. </span><span>提交申请材料。</span><span>申请考生请于</span><strong><span><span>9月</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>18</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>上午</span><span>10点</span></span></span></strong><span><span>前</span></span><span>（</span><span>第一批</span><span>）</span><span>将个人简历和支撑材料</span><span>合并成一个</span><span>pdf</span><span>文档发送邮件，文件名为</span><span>“</span><strong><span><span>姓名</span><span>-本科学校名称-申请专业名称</span></span></strong><span>”</span><span>【</span><span>报考公共管理学专业应急管理方向的学生，文件名为</span><span>“</span><strong><span><span>姓名</span><span>-本科学校名称-</span></span></strong><strong><span>公共管理学（应急管理方向）</span></strong><span>】</span><span>提交至</span><span>指定</span><span>邮箱</span><strong><span>yjs</span></strong><strong><span>17</span></strong><strong><span>@cug.edu.cn</span></strong></p><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）</span><span>个人简历</span></p><p><span>内容包括个人基本信息、学习经历、科研经历</span><span>、</span><span>四六级、</span><span>大学成绩绩点或排名</span><span>、</span><span>获奖、科研成果等情况</span><span>，</span><span><span>控制在</span><span>1个页面</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）</span><span>支撑材料</span></p><p><span>①二代居民身份证、学生证原件扫描件；</span></p><p><span>②历年在校学习成绩单原件(盖推荐院校教务部门公章)扫描件；</span></p><p><span>③其他各种</span><span>能力证明</span><span><span>材料</span><span>(如大学英语四、六级考试成绩单、获奖证书、学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等)扫描件</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>3.材料审查</span><span>评议</span><span>。</span><span>我院</span><span>对申请考生的材料进行审查、评议，确定复试名单。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>报名</span><span>并</span><span>参加</span><span>综合</span><span>考核</span><span>。</span><span>9<span>月</span><span>21</span><span>日</span><span>9:00</span><span>，</span></span><span>研招网</span><span><span>推免服务系统</span></span><span><span>开通推免生报名功能，</span></span><span><span>推免生正式开始网上报名。</span></span><span>9<span>月</span><span>22</span><span>日</span><span>8:00</span></span><span>开始</span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>我院</span></span><span>开始</span><span><span>发送复试通知，</span></span><span>请考生注意及时接收复试通知</span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>我院</span></span><span><span>将</span></span><span>通过</span><span>线上结合</span><span>线下</span><span>形式</span><span>多批次</span><span>灵活</span><span>组织</span><span>开展</span><span>综合考核</span><span>，</span><span>请</span><span>考生</span><span>按时</span><span>参加</span><span>。</span><span>具体</span><span>时间</span><span>和</span><span>综合考核</span><span>安排</span><span>另行</span><span>通知</span><span>。</span><span>已报名</span><span>考</span><span>生</span><span>请</span><span>注意</span><span>及时</span><span>接收</span><span>相关</span><span>通知</span><span>并</span><span>按</span><span>要求</span><span>参加</span><span>综合考核</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>5.完成</span><span>录取手续。</span> <span>9<span>月</span><span>24</span><span>日</span><span>8:00</span></span><span>开始</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>我院</span><span>通过</span><span><span>推免</span></span><span><span>服务系统</span></span><span><span>发送待录取通知</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span>9<span>月</span><span>24</span><span>日</span><span>14:00</span></span> <span>开始</span><span>，</span><span>请</span><span>考生</span><span>及时</span><span>接收</span><span>待录取通知</span><span>。</span><span>接</span><span>收待</span><span>录取通知的申请考生名单经公示无异议后列入正式录取名单，不再参加统考。</span></p><p><span>6.</span><span><span>网报期间</span></span><span>，</span><span>我院</span><span>将</span><span>根据</span><span>报名情况</span><span>适时</span><span><span>及时组织</span></span><span>综合考核和</span><span><span>录取</span></span><span>工作</span><span><span>。</span> </span><span>请考试保持</span><span>电话</span><span>畅通。</span></p><p><span>五、复试</span><span>录取</span></p><p><span>1</span><span>.资格审核</span><span>。</span><span>我院</span><span>依据</span><span>材料严格</span><span>核对考生的申请信息，按接收条件严格审查申请考生的申请资格。</span></p><p><span>2</span><span>.复试形式</span><span>。</span><span>我院</span><span>采</span><span>取</span><span>线上</span> <span>方</span><span>式进行复试</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>3</span><span>.</span><span>复试时间</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>根据</span><span>报名</span><span>情况</span><span>适时</span><span>组织，</span><strong><span>复试具</span></strong><strong><span>体安排以邮件形式另行通知</span></strong><span>（</span><span><span>第一批次复试时间预计</span><span>9月20日</span></span><span>左右</span><span>）</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>复试内容</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>综合面试，满分</span><span>100分。</span></span></p><p><span>综合面试</span><span>重点考察考生的专业素养、创新精神和创新能力、思想政治素质和道德品质、实践能力、外语听说能力等。</span></p><p><span>全面考核考生对本学科（专业）理论知识和实践技能掌握程度，利用所学理论发现、分析和解决问题的能力，对本学科发展动态的了解以及在本专业领域发展的潜力。</span></p><p><span>5</span><span>.</span><span>综合</span><span>考核</span><span>成绩</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>成绩结果按百分制评分，保留至</span><span>小数点后两位。</span><span>综合考核</span><span><span>成绩</span><span>=</span></span><span><span>综合面试成绩</span><span>*100%。</span></span></p><p><span>6.</span><span>录取规则</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>根据招生专业目录公布的推免计划，按照申请考生复试成绩排序确定</span><span>拟录取名单。</span><span>综合考核</span><span>成绩不合格不予录取</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>六</span><span>、</span><span>其他事项</span></p><p><span>1.申请考生必须保证所提交申请材料的真实性和准确性，一旦发现申请考生提交的信息不真实或</span><span>不准确，</span><span>我院</span><span>将不予录取或取消录取资格。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>复试名单、复试成绩及拟录取名单在</span><span>我院</span><span>官网公示。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>复试和拟录取</span><span>阶段不组织体检</span><span>，</span><span>拟录取的推</span><span>免生参加新生入学体检。</span></p><p><span>4</span><span>.</span><span>我校确定接收的推免生，在入学报到时未获得本科毕业证书者，学校将取消其录取资格。</span></p><p><span>5</span><span>.</span><span>监督与申诉渠道</span><span>。</span><span><span>研究生院招生管理办公室：电话：</span><span>027-67885153，邮箱</span></span><span>：</span><a href=\"mailto:yzb@cug.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>yzb@cug.edu.cn</span></a><span>。</span></p><p><span>6</span><span>.</span><span>联系方式</span></p><p><span><span>通讯地址：湖北省武汉市鲁磨路</span><span>388号中国地质大学（武汉）公共管理学院</span></span><span><span>北二楼</span><span>A211 </span></span><span>   <span>邮政编码：</span></span><span>430074</span></p><p><span>联系人：</span><span>杨</span><span><span>老师</span>   </span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span> <span>027-67883229</span></span></p><p><span>E-mail:</span><a href=\"mailto:yjs17@cug.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>yjs17@cug.edu.cn</span></a></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>公共管理</span><span>学院</span></p><p><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>9月</span></span><span>1</span><span>5</span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"76aad6733fa15332bea9ea3a6fb01b1ad930fb7447e45d8eed89c65a22912dfb","textLength":2240,"sourceSha256":"a442807fda266b2356dd4f72bc2c9f35fb2d20eac79c3d2273b5d0b83e25f1f6","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-afe428ab3a193bca4f10","title":"2026年中国地质大学（武汉）公共管理学院2027年接收推免生招生录取工作办法","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:31.912791+00:00"}
